Z||000000||Anders Lundin||10-19-2001||05:37 AM||||I have checked my thermostat in hot water and it opens correctly. But the cooler gets warm before the temperature is up. There is a 1-2 mm opening around the mowing thermostat part in closed condition, should this be completely closed or is there another possible way for the water to reach the cooler. In Sweden there are few Fieros and no part dealers, this gives me problems to see and compare quickly.<BR>Grateful for answers.<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||5
